      "text": "POST /auth/account/login \nbody - email password \n200 - access_token\n400 401 429 5xx\n\nPOST /auth/account/register\nbody - email password name nickname avatar_file_id\n201\n400 409 429 5xx\n\nPOST /auth/account/logout\nheader - jwt\n204\n401 5xx\n\nPOST /auth/account/confirm-otp\nbody - email otp_code\n204\n400 409 429 5xx\n\nPOST /auth/account/reset-password\nbody - email\n204\n400 429 5xx\n\nPUT /auth/account/change-password\nheader - jwt\nbody - old_password new_password\n204\n400 401 429 5xx\n\n\n\nPOST /auth/token/refresh\nbody - refresh_token\n200 - access_token\n400 401 429 5xx\n\n\n\nGET /auth/profile\nheader - jwt\n200\n401 5xx\n\nPUT /auth/profile\nheader - jwt\nbody - email name nickname avatar_file_id\n200\n400 401 409 5xx\n\nDELETE /auth/profile\nheader - jwt\n204\n401 5xx\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------------\n\n\nPOST /auth/profiles/batch\nheader - jwt\nbody - list [account_uuid]\n200 - list [account_uuid name nickname avatar_file_id]\n400 401 403 5xx",
