      "text": "GET /ui/companies/{company_uuid}/members\nheader - jwt\n200 - list members company with profile\n401 403 404 5xx\naggregates:\n    - GET /companies/{company_uuid}/members\n    - POST /auth/profiles/batch\n\n\nGET /ui/projects/{project_uuid}/members\nheader - jwt\n200 - list members project with profile\n401 403 404 5xx\naggregates:\n    - GET /projects/{project_uuid}/members\n    - POST /auth/profiles/batch\n\n\nGET /ui/projects/{project_uuid}/tasks/new\nheader - jwt\n200 - data for create task\n401 403 404 5xx\naggregates:\n    - GET /projects/{project_uuid}/statuses\n    - GET /projects/{project_uuid}/tags\n    - GET /projects/{project_uuid}/priorities\n    - GET /ui/projects/{project_uuid}/members\n\nGET /ui/projects/{project_uuid}/tasks/{task_uuid}\nheader - jwt\n200\n401 403 404 5xx\naggregates:\n    - GET /ui/projects/{project_uuid}/members\n    - GET /projects/{project_uuid}/tasks/{task_uuid}/comments\n\n\nGET /ui/projects/{project_uuid}/tasks/{task_uuid}/assignees\nheader - jwt\n200 - list assignments in task\n401 403 404 5xx\naggregates:\n    - GET /tasks/{task_uuid}/assignments\n    - POST /auth/profiles/batch\n\n\nGET /ui/projects/{project_uuid}/tasks/{task_uuid}/comments\nheader - jwt\n200 - list comments in task\n401 403 404 5xx\naggregates:\n    - GET /projects/{project_uuid}/tasks/{task_uuid}/comments\n    - POST /auth/profiles/batch\n",
